            5 大梯队深度测评
          </span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1.5">深入剖析各机场线路架构、解封表现、价格优势与适用场景</p>
      </div>

      <!-- 1. EdgeNova -->
      <div id="edgenova" class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xs relative overflow-hidden space-y-5">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-slate-100 pb-5">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
            <img src="./edgenova_logo.png" alt="EdgeNova" class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl object-cover border border-slate-200 shadow-md shrink-0" />
            <div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-blue-600 text-white text-xs font-bold rounded-md font-mono">NO.01 综合首选</span>
                <span class="text-xs text-amber-500 font-bold font-mono">RATING: 9.8 / 10</span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mt-1">
                1. EdgeNova —— 纯血 IEPL 专线架构，综合评分 9.8 推荐首选
              </h3>
            </div>
          </div>
          <a href="https://cristyc.edgenovaaff.cc/#/register?code=WWiIvxL9" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="px-6 py-3 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white text-xs sm:text-sm font-extrabold rounded-xl transition-all shadow-md flex items-center justify-center gap-2 shrink-0">
            <span>前往 EdgeNova 官网 (8折码: xk808)</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"></path></svg>
          </a>
        </div>

