          <div class="p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 space-y-1.5">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-emerald-600">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-600"></span> 实测体验
            </h4>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              千兆家庭宽带下，晚高峰（20:00 - 23:00）多节点连通率达到 100% 全绿，YouTube 4K 拖拽无感秒开，多线程海外大文件下载可轻松跑满 80~100MB/s 峰值带宽。
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 space-y-1.5">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-purple-600">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-purple-600"></span> 原生解锁支持
            </h4>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              出口 IP 极度纯净，无被标记黑历史，原生解锁 Netflix 全区（非自制剧）、Disney+，完美支持 ChatGPT（包括 GPT-4o 模型）与 Google Gemini 稳定调用。
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 space-y-1.5">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-indigo-600">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-600"></span> 客户端生态与性价比
            </h4>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              除支持 Clash Verge Rev、Sing-box、Shadowrocket 等主流通用订阅外，官方还配套了全平台极简客户端。常规月付 ¥15 起，折后仅需 7.2 元/月。
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-2">
          <a href="https://cristyc.edgenovaaff.cc/#/register?code=WWiIvxL9" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 group">
            <span>👉 前往 EdgeNova 官网享受限时 8 折特惠（专属优惠码：xk808）</span>
            <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 2. 速界 SpeedWorld -->
      <div id="sujie" class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xs relative overflow-hidden space-y-5">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-slate-100 pb-5">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
            <img src="./sujie_logo.png" alt="速界" class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl object-cover border border-slate-200 shadow-md shrink-0" />
            <div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-indigo-600 text-white text-xs font-bold rounded-md font-mono">游戏加速优选</span>
                <span class="text-xs text-amber-500 font-bold font-mono">RATING: 9.6 / 10</span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mt-1">
                2. 速界 (SpeedWorld) —— 电竞与跨服网游优选，超低延迟与零丢包
              </h3>
            </div>
          </div>
          <a href="https://aaa.jichang.best/#/register?code=M4UujXjz" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="px-6 py-3 bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white text-xs sm:text-sm font-extrabold rounded-xl transition-all shadow-md flex items-center justify-center gap-2 shrink-0">
            <span>前往速界官网 (开启极速专线)</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"></path></svg>
          </a>
        </div>

        <p class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed font-medium">
          对于需要兼顾 Steam、外服网游对战、Discord 语音以及大流量翻墙的用户，速界主打的是“端到端低抖动传输”。
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <div class="p-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 space-y-2">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900">⚡ 线路与协议架构</h4>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
