            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
            <div class="p-3.5 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-100">
              <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-xs block mb-1">🎮 游戏深度优化</span>
              <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs leading-relaxed">全线低丢包率专线直连，大幅削减海外跨服（港服、日服、美服等）网络延迟波动。</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3.5 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-100">
              <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-xs block mb-1">💯 无套路 1.0 倍率</span>
